            "69010402": {
              "Title": "",
              "Desc": "· DMG dealt to boss enemies by Attribute Anomaly is increased by 50%. While Notorious - Dead End Butcher is in <color=#FFFFFF>Ether Enhanced</color> state, the DMG it takes is reduced by 15%, and the Daze value dealt by Agents to it is reduced by 30%. Triggering <color=#FFFFFF>Disorder</color> on Notorious - Dead End Butcher immediately forces it to exit the <color=#FFFFFF>Ether Enhanced</color> state."
