              "Desc": "· Agent Anomaly Proficiency <color=#2BAD00>increases by 30 pts</color>, and <color=#FFFFFF>Abloom</color> deals <color=#2BAD00>10% bonus</color> DMG.\n· After inflicting <color=#FFFFFF>Abloom</color> on enemies, enemy <color=#98EFF0>Ice RES</color> <color=#2BAD00>drops by 25%</color>, and Agents deal <color=#2BAD00>30% bonus</color> <color=#98EFF0>Ice DMG</color> for 15s. Repeated triggers reset the duration."
